==== 2.3.2 CAR(chemically amplified resist) 메커니즘

```text
  Exposure: photon -> PAG (photo acid generator) -> H+ (acid)
  PEB     : H+ + protected polymer -> deprotected polymer + H+ (catalytic x100+)
            acid diffuses several nm (blur); quencher (base) kills stray acid
  Develop : deprotected (polar) polymer dissolves in TMAH  -> positive image
```

