=== 2.8 다중 패터닝

```text
   LELE (Litho-Etch-Litho-Etch)         SADP (Self-Aligned Double Patterning)

   1st litho/etch:  |  |  |  |          mandrel:     ####      ####
   2nd litho/etch:    |  |  |  |        spacer dep:  s####s    s####s
   result (pitch/2):|||||||||||||       mandrel rm:  s    s    s    s
   -> overlay between 1st/2nd matters   -> pitch/2 from spacer, no overlay
                                        -> "pitch walking" if mandrel CD off

   SAQP: repeat spacer step twice -> pitch/4
```

